{"sections":[{"slug":"Harish-Chandra模","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Harish-Chandra模"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Harish-Chandra <span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"subject":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何表示论</span>"},"page-title":{"Plain":"Harish-Chandra 模"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $H\\subset G$ <span lang=\"zh\">是代数子群</span>, $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lie代数","text":"Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">一个</span> $\\mathfrak g$-<span lang=\"zh\">模称为</span> Harish-Chandra <span lang=\"zh\">模</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">又称</span> $(\\mathfrak g,H)$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">是指其</span> $\\mathfrak h$-<span lang=\"zh\">作用可积为</span> $H$-<span lang=\"zh\">作用</span>. (<span lang=\"zh\">这是一个性质而非额外结构</span>.)</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">更一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">设代数群</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">作用于</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且有</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数的嵌入</span> $\\mathfrak{k} \\to \\mathfrak g$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$K$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathfrak k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的伴随作用与</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的作用相容</span>;</li>\n<li>$\\mathfrak k$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的伴随作用与诱导自</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">的作用相同</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个</span> Harish-Chandra $(\\mathfrak g,K)$-<span lang=\"zh\">模是一个</span> $\\mathfrak g$-<span lang=\"zh\">模和</span> $K$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $M$, <span lang=\"zh\">两者诱导的</span> $\\mathfrak k$-<span lang=\"zh\">模结构相同</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $\\mathfrak g\\otimes M\\to M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $K$-<span lang=\"zh\">模同态</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">作为形式群概形的表示</span></h3>\n<p>Harish-Chandra <span lang=\"zh\">二元组</span> $(\\mathfrak g,K)$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/形式概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">形式群概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\exp (\\mathfrak g,K)$, Harish-Chandra $(\\mathfrak g,K)$-<span lang=\"zh\">模等同于</span> $\\exp(\\mathfrak g,K)$-<span lang=\"zh\">表示</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">半单</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则中心商</span> $U_0\\mathfrak g:= U\\mathfrak g\\otimes_{Z(\\mathfrak g)}k_{\\chi}$ ($\\chi\\colon Z(\\mathfrak g)\\to k$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $Z(\\mathfrak g)$ <span lang=\"zh\">作用在平凡</span> $\\mathfrak g$-<span lang=\"zh\">表示上给出的特征</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">只是平凡子群的</span> Harish-Chandra <span lang=\"zh\">模</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">平凡模</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">自身的</span> Harish-Chandra <span lang=\"zh\">模</span>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Verma模","text":"Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal U\\mathfrak g\\otimes_{\\mathcal U\\mathfrak b}\\operatorname{det}(\\mathfrak g/\\mathfrak b)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $(\\mathfrak g,B)$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">更一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $H$-<span lang=\"zh\">表示</span> $W$,\n$$\r\n\\mathcal U\\mathfrak g\\otimes_{\\mathcal U\\mathfrak h} W\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $(\\mathfrak g,H)$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">与</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/D-模","text":"D-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的关系</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在几何侧</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/Beilinson–Bernstein局部化","text":"Beilinson–Bernstein <span lang=\"zh\">局部化</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">将</span> Harish-Chandra <span lang=\"zh\">模对应到</span> $H$-<span lang=\"zh\">等变</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/D-模","text":"D-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的子范畴</span> $\\mathrm D\\text{-}\\mathrm {mod}(\\mathrm {Fl}_G)^H\\subset \\mathrm D\\text{-}\\mathrm {mod}(\\mathrm {Fl}_G)$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}